  "title": "Under Armour to Host UA Next: City Classic Baltimore",
  "summary": "This year, UA is bringing 20 of the best boys and girls high school basketball players each from all over North America to its hometown to compete in its marquee showcase event of the summer. The City Classic is set for Saturday, August 15 at St. Frances Academy in Baltimore, MD with the girls' game set for 12 p.m. ET. and the boys’ game to follow at 2 p.m. ET.",
